config SAI_CHECK_ISR_TIMING
	bool "Measure the SAI DMA interrupt time instead of running the checks"
	depends on TRACING_USER
	help
	  Time every DMA interrupt of the SAI TX and RX channels with the DWT cycle
	  counter (user tracing hooks) while both directions stream, and print the
	  statistics. Enable with variants/isr_timing.conf.

config SAI_CHECK_DROP_STORM
	bool "Run the DROP stress test instead of the checks"
	help
	  Use 8-frame blocks and DROP the TX and RX streams 1000 times each,
	  sweeping the DROP time across two block periods so that it lands on
	  every phase of the DMA block-end interrupt. After each DROP, check that
	  all blocks are returned and that the stream restarts. Enable with
	  variants/drop_storm.conf.

source "Kconfig.zephyr"
